---
import Icon from '@/components/Icon.astro'
---

<section id="fitur" class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="rapi-container">
    <div class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-rapi-blue">Fitur</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-display-lg font-extrabold">
        Tiga cara nyatat.<br class="hidden sm:block" /> Pilih yang paling nggak ngerepotin.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento: ukuran kartu sengaja beda-beda.
         Grid seragam bikin semua fitur terasa sama penting — padahal nggak.
         "Ketik" itu jalan utama, jadi dia dapat ruang paling besar. -->
    <div data-stagger class="mt-12 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-6">
      <!-- Kartu utama -->
      <article
        class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-rapi-xl bg-rapi-navy p-8 text-white lg:col-span-4 lg:row-span-2"
      >
        <div
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-rapi-blue/40 blur-3xl transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-125"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <span class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-rapi-md bg-rapi-yellow text-rapi-navy">
            <Icon name="keyboard" />
          </span>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-display-md font-extrabold">Ketik sekenanya</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/65">
            Tulis apa adanya, seperti ngabarin teman. Nominal, kategori, dan jenis
            transaksinya kebaca sendiri — dan Rapi selalu nunjukin tebakannya dulu
            sebelum menyimpan, jadi nggak ada yang masuk diam-diam.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {
              ['nasi padang 32rb', 'gaji 3jt', 'grab 18rb', 'listrik 250rb'].map((c) => (
                <span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-white/70">
                  {c}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rapi-card lg:col-span-2">
        <span class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-rapi-md bg-rapi-blue/10 text-rapi-blue">
          <Icon name="mic" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-[18px] font-bold">Ngomong aja</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-rapi-gray-600">
          Tangan penuh belanjaan? Sebutin transaksinya, Rapi yang nulis.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rapi-card lg:col-span-2">
        <span class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-rapi-md bg-rapi-blue/10 text-rapi-blue">
          <Icon name="camera" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-[18px] font-bold">Foto struknya</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-rapi-gray-600">
          Jepret struk, AI-nya baca sendiri totalnya. Nggak usah ngetik satu-satu.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Kartu kuning — satu-satunya di halaman, jadi mata pasti mampir -->
      <article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-rapi-xl bg-rapi-yellow p-8 lg:col-span-3">
        <span class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-rapi-md bg-rapi-navy text-rapi-yellow">
          <Icon name="chat" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-[22px] font-extrabold text-rapi-navy">Rapi AI</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-rapi-navy/70">
          Tanya "aku boros nggak sih bulan ini?" — dijawab pakai catatanmu yang
          beneran, bukan jawaban umum yang bisa dikasih ke siapa aja.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rapi-card lg:col-span-3">
        <span class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-rapi-md bg-rapi-blue/10 text-rapi-blue">
          <Icon name="chart" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-[18px] font-bold">Laporan yang ngomong</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-rapi-gray-600">
          Bukan cuma grafik. Rapi sebutin kategori paling nyedot dan bandingannya
          dengan bulan lalu — hal yang nggak kelihatan dari angka saja.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rapi-card lg:col-span-3">
        <span class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-rapi-md bg-rapi-blue/10 text-rapi-blue">
          <Icon name="trend" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-[18px] font-bold">Investasi</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-rapi-gray-600">
          Saham, reksa dana, kripto, emas. Untung ruginya kehitung sendiri.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rapi-card lg:col-span-3">
        <span class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-rapi-md bg-rapi-blue/10 text-rapi-blue">
          <Icon name="cloud" class="h-5 w-5" />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-[18px] font-bold">Sinkron otomatis</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-rapi-gray-600">
          Catat di HP, kebuka di laptop. Datamu ikut ke mana pun kamu masuk.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
